NO LICENCE HAS BEEN CHOSEN YET.

This file is a placeholder. It is not a licence and it grants nothing.

Until the owner of this repository replaces this file with an actual licence
text, the legal default applies: all rights are reserved. Nobody other than the
copyright holder has permission to use, copy, modify, merge, publish,
distribute, sublicense or sell this software, and the absence of a stated
licence is not permission.

A LICENCE MUST BE SET BEFORE THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLISHED.

Choosing one is the owner's decision and nobody else's. It is not a formality:
the choice determines whether anyone may run this, whether they may modify it
privately, whether a modified copy they run as a network service must be shared
back, and whether the owner keeps a patent claim. Those are business decisions,
not engineering ones.

To resolve this:

  1. Choose a licence. https://choosealicense.com/ walks through the trade-offs.
  2. Replace the whole of this file with that licence's exact, unmodified text.
  3. Fill in the copyright line with the year and the copyright holder's name.
  4. Add a `license` field to the root `package.json` naming its SPDX
     identifier, and update the Licence section of README.md.

Until all four are done, treat this repository as private.
